      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "&& means and: isNear && hasKey is true only when both are true. isNear is worked out every frame from the distance to Visitor 5. hasKey turns true when Give Key is called. When either one is false, the else block runs and the door stays shut.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Has Key is off, and Visitor 5 is right at the door. Does Door 5 open?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play and select Door 5.\n2. Watch Is Near and the door as the visitor walks.\n3. Right-click Key Door \u203A Give Key, and watch again."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
