  m_text: "<b>Exercise \xB7 Change</b>\n\n<b>Task:</b>\n1. Press Play. Click E6 \xB7 Give a key, then E6 \xB7 Open: one key opens Door E6.\n2. In ChangeKeyDoor.cs, replace hasKey with an int keyCount that GiveKey counts up.\n3. Make Open open the door only when keyCount is 3 or more."
