  m_text: "currentCount is a private variable of CounterTrigger. Its value changes while the game runs: each call to Add One runs currentCount++, and ++ adds one to it. The values a script's variables hold at a given moment are its state. The Inspector shows them under Private (read-only).\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You click 1 \xB7 Add One three times, then stop Play. What does Current Count show in the Inspector?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play and select Counter 1.\n2. Click 1 \xB7 Add One, and watch Current Count in the Inspector.\n3. Stop Play, and read Current Count again."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
