  m_text: "<b>Exercise \xB7 Fix</b>\n\n<b>Task:</b>\n1. Press Play, select Countdown E5, and watch Current Time.\n2. Lamp E5 never lights, and Current Time goes below 0. Find out why.\n3. Fix the condition, so that the countdown stops at 0."
