      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "An enum is a type with a fixed list of named values. The state of LockedDoor is Closed, Open or Locked. Open tests them in order with if, else if and else: only the first block whose condition is true runs. TrafficLight uses an enum in the same way.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Door 6 starts Locked. You click 6 \xB7 Unlock, then 6 \xB7 Open twice. Which block runs on the second Open?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play, select Door 6 and open Code Watch.\n2. Click 6 \xB7 Open, and read the Console.\n3. Click 6 \xB7 Unlock, then 6 \xB7 Open twice."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
