  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Unity calls Update once every frame. Time.deltaTime is the time the last frame took, in seconds. Step 1 of TimeTrigger's Update adds it to currentTime every frame, so currentTime counts seconds at any frame rate. When it reaches the Duration, On Finished fires and lights Lamp 4.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Lamp 4 lights up after 3 seconds. By then, has the line currentTime += Time.deltaTime; run 3 times, or many more?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play, select Timer 4 and open Code Watch.\n2. Watch Current Time count up, and Lamp 4.\n3. Set Duration to 6, and click 4 \xB7 Start Timer."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
