      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "isOpen is a bool: true or false. ! means not, so isOpen = !isOpen turns it over. Then if (isOpen) runs its block when isOpen is true, and else runs the other block when it is false. Each call runs exactly one of the two blocks.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> isOpen starts false. You click 3 \xB7 Flip twice. Which block ran on the second click, the if or the else?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play, select Gate 3 and open Code Watch.\n2. Click 3 \xB7 Flip, and watch Lamp 3 and the two blocks.\n3. Click 3 \xB7 Flip again."
